Provider brand icons in src/client/ProviderIcon.tsx
Reviewed 2026-11-03. These marks identify the corresponding sign-in providers.
Brand trademarks remain the property of their respective owners.

Google:
The gradient G PNG in src/client/assets/google.png is copied unchanged from
Google's official sign-in branding guidelines. Its original colors, proportions
and transparent background are retained. No button frame is added to the icon.
Artwork source:
https://developers.google.com/static/identity/images/g-logo.png
Branding and usage guidelines:
https://developers.google.com/identity/branding-guidelines
Google and the Google logo are trademarks of Google LLC.

GitHub:
The mark-github-16 vector path is from GitHub's Primer Octicons, distributed
under the MIT license reproduced in LICENSE.github. Its monochrome fill follows
the site's light/dark theme. No runtime icon-library dependency is required.
Pinned artwork source:
https://github.com/primer/octicons/blob/ea8e6bb79894cc7e85564ee9b53d86b418738d04/icons/mark-github-16.svg
Logo guidelines:
https://github.com/logos

